  "$id": "urn:tennis:common:2.0.0",
  "title": "Unified Tennis CSV contract 2.0.0",
  "description": "Same 52-column lexical contract as source input, with common round labels and project-level canonical identities. Source identities and actual match dates remain in provenance/crosswalks.",
